name mahjong
category Package
revision 58896
shortdesc Typeset Mahjong Tiles using MPSZ Notation
longdesc The mahjong package provides a LaTeX2e and LaTeX3 interface for
longdesc typesetting mahjong tiles using an extended version of MPSZ
longdesc algebraic notation. Features include spaces, rotated, blank,
longdesc and concealed tiles, as well as red fives. The size of the
longdesc mahjong tiles can be controlled using a package option and an
longdesc optional argument of \mahjong. It is primarily aimed at Riichi
longdesc (aka. Japanese) Mahjong but can be used to typeset any style of
longdesc mahjong.
